    "r0": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "Row 1: Scope mode\n\nRight bar page 1 is the action page. The CTRL page: Display (Normal / Phosphor / X-Y with icons, phosphor parameters inside), Trace style, Grid, the V+ / CH / V- steppers, 50 % TRIG. ACQ holds acquisition only. The top bar loses only the version string; its chips share one construction.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 6160,
      "y": 0
    },
    "r1": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "Row 2: main menu, Spectrum (action page, CTRL page, Display and Analysis fold-outs), Settings fold-out, USB drive\n\nSpectrum's CTRL page: Display (Spectrum / Waterfall / Density with icons), Analysis (FFT length, Window, Average, Reset), Axis (Scale, Ref level), Grid, V+ / CH / V- steppers, 50 % TRIG. No strip, no header line: peak, level and RBW are bottom-row cards. AUTO SET is the spectrum's Auto.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 6160,
      "y": 600
    },
    "r2": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "Row 3: calibration wizard, owner's four screens, confirmation, first run\n\nZero level, CH1 gain, CH2 gain, Done. One instruction, a progress or result line, Cancel and Calibrate (Continue after success), Save calibration at the end. Cancel writes nothing.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 6160,
      "y": 1200
    },
    "r3": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "Row 4: Settings screen, Diagnostics (Status, Calibration, Log, Developer), enter-FEL confirmation\n\nFrom the adversarial reviews (docs/plans/diagnostics-review.md, ux-review.md). Look of the new screens (stock palette or not) is still an open owner decision.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 6160,
      "y": 1800
